==English==

===Etymology===
{{suffix|reasonable|ly}}

===Adverb===
{{en-adv}}

# In accordance with [[reason]].
#: ''They were able handle their disagreements '''reasonably'''.''
# Not [[extremely]].
# [[fairly|Fairly]].
# [[inexpensively|Inexpensively]].
#: ''The shoes were '''reasonably''' priced.''

